          "name": "What areas in Kern County do you serve?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS provides commercial pickups throughout Bakersfield and Kern County, including Downtown, Rosedale, Seven Oaks, Oildale, Stockdale, and neighboring areas like Delano, Shafter, Wasco, and Arvin. Organizations searching for electronics recycling near me throughout Bakersfield find STS provides scheduled pickup across all regional commercial corridors."
