            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. STS provides comprehensive IT asset disposition and remarketing solutions for qualifying enterprise hardware. We evaluate late-model servers, workstations, laptops, and networking assets to offset decommissioning costs and deliver maximum financial return for Bakersfield commercial organizations."
